<title>POLAND: UNIVERSAL JUNE GROUP LOSS AT PLN 1.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>UNIVERSAL JUNE GROUP LOSS AT PLN 1.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE			    1997</p>
<p> Group net loss		 1.51</p>
<p> Group pre-tax loss	   0.19</p>
<p> Group sales		   81.34</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE		  1997</p>
<p> Group net profit	    13.04</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	21.60</p>
<p> Group sales		  403.25</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish trader is Universal SA. The</p>
<p>company gave no comparison figures but said January-June net</p>
<p>profit rose more than 5.5 times, pre-tax profit 364 per cent</p>
<p>and sales 166 per cent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
